{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:23:52.970659", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is based on a scalable SDN spine-leaf topology. It includes:\\n- **OVS Switches**: `leaf_1`, `leaf_2`, `spine_1`\\n- **Hosts**: `host_1_1`, `host_1_2`, `host_2_1`, `host_2_2`\\n- **Subnets**:\\n  - Host subnet: `10.0.0.0/24`\\n  - Management subnet: `20.0.0.0/24`\\n- **SDN Controller**: Located at `20.0.0.100`, managing switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### Reachability Test Results\\nThe reachability test was conducted between hosts in the network. Below are the findings:\\n\\n1. **Host-to-Host Connectivity**:\\n   - **`host_1_1` to `host_2_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\\n   - **`host_1_2` to `host_1_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\\n   - **`host_1_2` to `host_2_1`**: Status is `ok`. 2 packets were transmitted and received successfully with 0% packet loss. RTT statistics:\\n     - Average RTT: 4.486 ms\\n     - Minimum RTT: 1.902 ms\\n     - Maximum RTT: 7.071 ms\\n     - RTT Mean Deviation: 2.584 ms\\n   - **`host_2_1` to `host_1_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\\n   - **`host_2_2` to `host_1_1`**: Status is `unknown`. No packets were transmitted or received, and no RTT data is available.\\n   - **`host_2_2` to `host_2_1`**: Status is `ok`. 2 packets were transmitted and received successfully with 0% packet loss. RTT statistics:\\n     - Average RTT: 3.639 ms\\n     - Minimum RTT: 0.908 ms\\n     - Maximum RTT: 6.37 ms\\n     - RTT Mean Deviation: 2.731 ms\\n\\n#### Observations\\n1. **Connectivity Issues**:\\n   - Several host-to-host connections are marked as `unknown`, indicating potential anomalies in the network. Specifically:\\n     - `host_1_1` is unable to communicate with `host_2_1`.\\n     - `host_1_2` is unable to communicate with `host_1_1`.\\n     - `host_2_1` is unable to communicate with `host_1_1`.\\n     - `host_2_2` is unable to communicate with `host_1_1`.\\n\\n2. **Successful Connections**:\\n   - `host_1_2` successfully communicates with `host_2_1`.\\n   - `host_2_2` successfully communicates with `host_2_1`.\\n\\n3. **RTT Analysis**:\\n   - The RTT values for successful connections are within acceptable ranges, with no packet loss observed.\\n\\n#### Diagnosis Summary\\nThe network exhibits partial connectivity issues. While some host-to-host connections are functional, others fail to establish communication. The root cause of these anomalies needs further investigation, focusing on:\\n- Host `host_1_1`, which appears to be isolated.\\n- The underlying SDN controller and OpenFlow rules.\\n- The spine-leaf topology and switch configurations.\\n\\nFurther analysis is required to localize the faulty devices and identify the root cause of the connectivity issues., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='5f1c6b25-57cb-4c9f-beb6-eebfd4bee581'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
